{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2350cb91ce77ab770b5acdfaf00a338856373f1138728f830e3907cc30a7394c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c302954346e9a3d12a38675be4c01f09dbf39204cb2a978385ecd39f180b13f7",
      "text": "运动会结束后",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000015:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4cff96fce593bb2c5bd1d3a96918a7fe30c349f35c40cf8eb006226775250d6",
      "text": "再次跟大家说一声，运动会辛苦啦！\n哎呀——，每项比赛都\n超级热血沸腾啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000017:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9195f5d851b68fb0de082eb7912b9bc1411beb1bb49a57aedc5d95b113ce78c",
      "text": "大家都干劲\n拉满了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000019:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0e85de300b2a8a63d396930ebf0541325dc8ad49ea788f00f1a1237790adcd",
      "text": "315 Production自己办的\n运动会，感觉也\n挺不错的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000021:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cccfdc3708bbfdc27d48473d4109659733671306081122a458cf9e537989064e",
      "text": "毕竟大家聚在一起的机会\n平时可不多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000023:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9378f66ccd56220a034fc0f0fb0a1a6d683993bfd5a4b7ea2d7a20d9a29f27",
      "text": "不只是正式比赛，\n之前的练习和作战会议\n都超级开心的<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000025:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fcecfd9c3e10f3cd6ab23cabfeb41ee66efb05cd18d433ebe0c74372821339",
      "text": "说起来，\n实先生拍了不少花絮照呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000027:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a168ba3e93ab26d6f4ad9b838a5932b2dac9b5c15731aa26b39d1548c83cf77",
      "text": "我也看到了！\n拍了好多不同的照片呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000029:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b72f6361a78147cac3c1c03c8807dd7b9c389c88db3929ce897259614dfac36",
      "text": "应援团的照片什么的\n超级帅气哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000031:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa5dd4b2f6e5e318fab42e06026606ead479f915138dfaa593accac1878f98c7",
      "text": "粉丝大家也都\n情绪高涨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000033:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922e5ea37e7518d32b8ddb5e43631e506826b0798e5cfd0d6ecb7e01056c1743",
      "text": "啊啊，大家笑得超级开心的。\n还想再和大家一起\n办运动会啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000035:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93822660e32a2aef70c6155475b0e972b2aef06cb40a6478ed4d7b4a0e72b3e9",
      "text": "哎呀，真不错呢。\n如果再办运动会的话，\n大家想参加什么项目？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000037:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1694d574b9c75b94d9c3341519b89a6a3197bb9b3c33ca0b232801730123a68",
      "text": "想试一下这次没参加的\n项目呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000039:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6553849c45fdcfbc0b3cd78b07e48d4cfd055344cd8bed71cfc68dac6cf98a6d",
      "text": "我的话，想参加变装接力或者\n巨型沙滩排球\n试试看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000041:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:026fbc8ada58b4561f49dc4aa105f4c019ad63626928c305a72a6369fa146f06",
      "text": "我想跑接力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000043:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdf6a663c8621d42260a5b4447cff23d489700de401203e7c6e415e998289c2e",
      "text": "既是运动会的重头戏，\n而且最重要的是很帅气，感觉会很受女孩子欢迎<emoji>image_talk_emoji_12</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000045:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eade45e9a4b8ab5d5bee14f3d3119419110b0960ed43eda4c7bc8158ae51e51",
      "text": "很像秋山会有的理由呢。\n其他的话，玩玩这次没有的项目也\n挺有趣的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000047:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a04eb709137be4d155e6f54880c41b4ad48463798c92167a276caa0acd3193e3",
      "text": "两人三足，或者\n滚大球之类的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000049:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eae4d2f5ee412a2c0252deb2054aca529d98b08a99fccf388d8317527db27e4",
      "text": "还有推倒竹竿，以及\n骑马打仗也有吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000051:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c41cf67cef3cf2d3c8cce891db4efc7974c7eab3f0a9a007ae18b7d7154790b",
      "text": "咕呜～不管哪个项目都\n超级让人燃起来啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000053:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb0a08a7aa1356d5e498c282117a9f2b0e0541df55bc450d868d377ea93d19de",
      "text": "抱歉，我来晚了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000055:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f5dc54e122cdc590fbea1ded949b9a77c2c862f19ce0803133f8777f3637b57",
      "text": "哎呀，遇到什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000057:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23fe2884ff2810b635bc410529874a5302dbd917f6921e4ca53a4e80684696f8",
      "text": "山下君也肌肉酸痛了，\n我刚去给他送膏药。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000059:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3fd33dce26ea0f1206885df47ad6fe0742e71b1369dc0605e692b8accfac238",
      "text": "次郎老师，\n不要紧吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000061:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3a336b9f40790be3e8134b3e8654e05ca2439b4f9b6efecba54cf75dbf36a19",
      "text": "肌肉酸痛的时候，\n做做适度的拉伸\n比较好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000063:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4925944a9f698e396a91674cc635ffade63ff3fdea8f1ff3bf887143c66c9d2f",
      "text": "泡个澡揉一揉也不错",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000065:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7d6e5d0015b85c4d27ba509113c7fc0c30f8aff3f329b9f9864d02b764e1828",
      "text": "都筑先生平时也\n不怎么运动呢。以防万一，\n我跟他说一声吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000067:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:506870c5d8bc69e77d5d174dc9b40db126bb2c77a54cb7cb16cd73be300228bb",
      "text": "肌肉酸痛暂且不论，\n所有人都能无伤平安结束，\n真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000069:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728875fe370372e4caa415c37f52961ff20e2bb398dafc03a49a56d41b358e3b",
      "text": "是的！而且通过这次的\n运动会，感觉和大家的\n羁绊又加深了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000071:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df45a505c45d45278291052b5bfec08bd7e1f2ccbdd2b818370b453324bdeba2",
      "text": "创造了这个机会的\n制作人，真得好好\n感谢一下呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000073:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc09110574ff4761436443558b6b662025811bcffea2b6bc49ecb9d27a2973dd",
      "text": "还有提出办运动会的\n社长也是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000075:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96e54387011e39459284dfa3cff28b70fdad5ca08fa46937db22f89286688c8",
      "text": "是啊。\n以后再大家一起搞点什么活动，\n粉丝应该也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_04_000_22_5_04_000_22:5_04_000_22:cmd-000077:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca527412f2c1eb5c19aa614b7fa8a51af1c84bc9e7226ea231d7f3ac4b178e43",
      "text": "哦，这主意不错。\n要是再分胜负的话，我可不会输哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
